# Dotfiles Zsh Modular Skill

**Trigger**: Use when designing or debugging modular Zsh configurations — numbered module sourcing, Zinit plugin management, Starship prompt, encrypted secrets loading, workplace-specific configs.

**Goal**: Provide complete reference for Zsh modular patterns from `fabiosouzadev/dotfiles` enabling maintainable, profile-aware shell configuration.

---

## 1. Architecture Overview

### Module Structure

```
home/
├── dot_zshrc.tmpl              # Main entry point (sources modules)
├── dot_zshrc.d/                # Module directory (numbered 099-999)
│   ├── 099-environment.zsh     # Environment variables (FIRST)
│   ├── 100-zinit.zsh           # Zinit plugin manager
│   ├── 110-omz.zsh             # Oh My Zsh libs
│   ├── 120-plugins.zsh         # Zsh plugins (fzf, zoxide, atuin, etc.)
│   ├── 130-history.zsh         # History config
│   ├── 140-completion.zsh      # Completion system
│   ├── 150-keybindings.zsh     # Key bindings
│   ├── 160-aliases.zsh         # Common aliases
│   ├── 170-functions.zsh       # Custom functions
│   ├── 180-tools.zsh           # Tool integrations (mise, docker, etc.)
│   ├── 190-vi-mode.zsh         # Vi mode config
│   ├── 200-workplace.zsh       # Workplace detection (Zup)
│   ├── 210-personal.zsh        # Personal laptop config
│   ├── 220-vps.zsh             # VPS config
│   ├── 300-ai-tools.zsh        # AI tools (aider, claude, etc.)
│   ├── 310-hermes.zsh          # Hermes integration
│   ├── 320-omniroute.zsh       # OmniRoute integration
│   ├── 330-coding-orchestrator.zsh  # Coding Orchestrator
│   ├── 999-compinit.zsh        # Compinit (LAST)
└── private_dot_config/
    ├── encrypted_api_keys.zsh.asc    # GPG-encrypted secrets
    ├── encrypted_ssh_config.zsh.asc
    └── encrypted_workplace.zsh.asc
```

### Sourcing Order (Critical)

```
1. 099-environment.zsh      → Env vars MUST be first (PATH, EDITOR, etc.)
2. 100-199: Core shell      → Zinit, plugins, history, completion, keys
3. 200-299: Profile-specific → Workplace, personal, VPS overrides
4. 300-399: AI integrations → Hermes, OmniRoute, Orchestrator
5. 999-compinit.zsh         → Compinit MUST be last
```

