## 3. Key Module Examples

### 099-environment.zsh (FIRST - PATH, EDITOR, etc.)

```zsh
# Environment Variables
export EDITOR="nvim"
export VISUAL="nvim"
export PAGER="less"
export LESS="-R"

# XDG Base Directories
export XDG_CONFIG_HOME="${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}"
export XDG_DATA_HOME="${XDG_DATA_HOME:-$HOME/.local/share}"
export XDG_CACHE_HOME="${XDG_CACHE_HOME:-$HOME/.cache}"
export XDG_STATE_HOME="${XDG_STATE_HOME:-$HOME/.local/state}"

# Local bin directories (mise, chezmoi scripts, etc.)
export PATH="$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH"
export PATH="$HOME/.cargo/bin:$PATH"
export PATH="$HOME/.go/bin:$PATH"

# Language-specific
export GOENV_ROOT="$HOME/.goenv"
export PYENV_ROOT="$HOME/.pyenv"
export NODE_ENV="${NODE_ENV:-development}"

# GPG
export GPG_TTY=$(tty)

# FZF
export FZF_DEFAULT_COMMAND="fd --type f --hidden --follow --exclude .git"
export FZF_CTRL_T_COMMAND="$FZF_DEFAULT_COMMAND"
export FZF_ALT_C_COMMAND="fd --type d --hidden --follow --exclude .git"

# Atuin
export ATUIN_SESSION=$(atuin uuid 2>/dev/null || echo "default")

# Mise (runtime version manager)
export MISE_DATA_DIR="$HOME/.local/share/mise"
export MISE_CONFIG_DIR="$HOME/.config/mise"
```

### 100-zinit.zsh (Plugin Manager)

```zsh
# Zinit Installation & Setup
ZINIT_HOME="${XDG_DATA_HOME:-$HOME/.local/share}/zinit/zinit.git"
if [[ ! -f "$ZINIT_HOME/zinit.zsh" ]]; then
  mkdir -p "$(dirname "$ZINIT_HOME")"
  git clone https://github.com/zdharma-continuum/zinit.git "$ZINIT_HOME"
fi
source "$ZINIT_HOME/zinit.zsh"

# Zinit Annexes
zinit light-mode for \
  zdharma-continuum/zinit-annex-as-monitor \
  zdharma-continuum/zinit-annex-bin-gem-node \
  zdharma-continuum/zinit-annex-patch-dl \
  zdharma-continuum/zinit-annex-rust
```

