## 4. Encrypted Secrets Loading Pattern

### In Template (Auto-decrypt on Source)

```go
{{- if .features.secrets.gpg }}
{{- $secrets := list
  "encrypted_api_keys.zsh.asc"
  "encrypted_ssh_config.zsh.asc"
  "encrypted_workplace.zsh.asc"
-}}
{{- range $secrets }}
# {{ . }} - GPG encrypted secrets
if [[ -f "{{ .chezmoi.homeDir }}/.config/{{ . }}" ]]; then
  source <(gpg --quiet --decrypt "{{ .chezmoi.homeDir }}/.config/{{ . }}" 2>/dev/null) || {
    print -P "%F{red}Failed to decrypt {{ . }}%f" >&2
  }
fi
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
```

### Manual Decrypt (for debugging)

```bash
# Decrypt to stdout
gpg --decrypt ~/.config/encrypted_api_keys.zsh.asc

# Decrypt to file
gpg --output ~/.config/api_keys.zsh --decrypt ~/.config/encrypted_api_keys.zsh.asc

# Test if gpg-agent is running
gpg-connect-agent /bye
```

