## 7. Common Issues & Fixes

| Issue | Cause | Fix |
|-------|-------|-----|
| `command not found` in module | Module loads before PATH set | Move to 099-environment.zsh or later |
| Compinit errors | Duplicate compinit calls | Ensure only 999-compinit.zsh calls compinit |
| Starship not showing | Starship init before compinit | Move `eval "$(starship init zsh)"` after compinit |
| GPG decrypt fails | gpg-agent not running | `gpg-connect-agent /bye` or `export GPG_TTY=$(tty)` |
| Zinit plugins not loading | Zinit not sourced first | Ensure 100-zinit.zsh sourced before 120-plugins.zsh |
| Work config on personal | Workplace detection wrong | Check `.chezmoi.yaml.tmpl` detection logic |

